  "idea": "Automated Slack channel cleanup bot for archived project channels",
  "text": "This automated Slack bot archives dead project channels after thirty days of total silence. When completed projects linger in your sidebar, important announcements get buried under abandoned discussions and notifications. Manual workspace audits take hours of administrative effort that managers continually postpone, letting channel sprawl explode unchecked. Set up a Zapier webhook connected to Slack that flags inactive channels and archives them automatically. You maintain a spotless workspace effortlessly.",
